<title>FINLAND: NORDIC ALUMINIUM JAN-APR PROFIT UP 11 PCT.</title>
<headline>NORDIC ALUMINIUM JAN-APR PROFIT UP 11 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	    7.2 vs 6.5</p>
<p> Earnings per share incl extras (markka)   0.64 vs 1.11</p>
<p> Earnings per share excl extras (markka)   1.11 vs 1.11</p>
<p> Net sales					  103.1 vs 106.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				   7.7 vs 8.5</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	14.0 vs 14.8</p>
<p> Depreciation					 6.4 vs 6.3</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 0.5 vs 2.0 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		     charge 3.0 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  4.2 vs 6.5</p>
<p> Taxes on profit				    2.1 vs 1.9</p>
<p> Taxes on extraordinary expense	  gain 0.8 vs nil</p>
<p> Net profit					   3.0 vs 4.7</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    35.6 vs 34.3 end-1996</p>
<p>NOTE - Finnish aluminium profiles and components maker's</p>
<p>full name is Nordic Aluminium Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
